<div style="width:1200px; box-sizing:border-box; padding:44px 40px 40px; background:#f8f6f2;">

  <div style="display:flex; align-items:baseline; justify-content:space-between; gap:32px; margin-bottom:6px;">
    <p class="lbl" style="color:#b07a3c;">Case one · how it was run</p>
    <p class="lbl" style="color:#b5a08a;">Toyota Experience Design</p>
  </div>
  <p class="disp" style="font-size:34px; margin-bottom:10px;">An internal consultancy, not a service desk</p>
  <p class="body" style="max-width:760px; color:#6b6057; font-size:15px; margin-bottom:38px;">Six disciplines under one roof, and four ways to buy them. A service catalogue, explicit positioning, and a P&amp;L.</p>

  <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:400px 1fr; gap:60px; align-items:start;">

    <div>
      <p class="lbl" style="color:#8a7d6e; padding-bottom:12px; border-bottom:1px solid #d8cec0; margin-bottom:0;">Six disciplines, one team</p>
      <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column;">
        <div style="padding:14px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #e8e2da;">
          <p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 3px;">Product design</p>
          <p style="font-size:13px; line-height:1.55; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">Insight, journeys and the screens themselves</p>
        </div>
        <div style="padding:14px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #e8e2da;">
          <p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 3px;">Design systems</p>
          <p style="font-size:13px; line-height:1.55; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">Components, tokens and design governance</p>
        </div>
        <div style="padding:14px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #e8e2da;">
          <p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 3px;">UX research</p>
          <p style="font-size:13px; line-height:1.55; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">Formative and evaluative customer insight</p>
        </div>
        <div style="padding:14px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #e8e2da;">
          <p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#b07a3c; margin:0 0 3px;">Service design</p>
          <p style="font-size:13px; line-height:1.55; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">Front stage experience and back stage operations</p>
        </div>
        <div style="padding:14px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #e8e2da;">
          <p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 3px;">Content and creative</p>
          <p style="font-size:13px; line-height:1.55; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">Words, tone of voice and art direction</p>
        </div>
        <div style="padding:14px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #e8e2da;">
          <p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 3px;">Design leadership</p>
          <p style="font-size:13px; line-height:1.55; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">Vision, planning and delivery</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p class="lbl" style="color:#8a7d6e; padding-bottom:12px; border-bottom:1px solid #d8cec0; margin-bottom:22px;">Four engagement models</p>

      <div style="display:flex; gap:14px;">
        <p style="writing-mode:vertical-rl; transform:rotate(180deg); font-size:11px; letter-spacing:0.13em; text-transform:uppercase; font-weight:600; color:#b5a08a; margin:0; text-align:center; height:320px;">Weeks &nbsp;———&nbsp; Years</p>

        <div style="flex-grow:1;">
          <div style="position:relative; height:320px; border-left:1px solid #d8cec0; border-bottom:1px solid #d8cec0; background:linear-gradient(to top right,rgba(176,122,60,0.04),rgba(176,122,60,0.13));">

            <div style="position:absolute; left:14%; bottom:12%;">
              <div style="width:10px; height:10px; border-radius:50%; background:#b07a3c;"></div>
              <div style="margin-top:8px; width:150px;">
                <p style="font-size:14px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 2px;">Innovation sprints</p>
                <p style="font-size:12px; line-height:1.5; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">Fast, exploratory, time-boxed</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div style="position:absolute; left:41%; bottom:42%;">
              <div style="width:10px; height:10px; border-radius:50%; background:#b07a3c;"></div>
              <div style="margin-top:8px; width:150px;">
                <p style="font-size:14px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 2px;">Team augmentation</p>
                <p style="font-size:12px; line-height:1.5; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0;">Specialists into an existing team</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div style="position:absolute; left:70%; bottom:20%;">
              <div style="width:10px; height:10px; border-radius:50%; background:#b07a3c;"></div>
              <div style="margin-top:8px; width:160px; transform:translateX(-100%); padding-right:16px;">
                <p style="font-size:14px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 2px; text-align:right;">Design studio</p>
                <p style="font-size:12px; line-height:1.5; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0; text-align:right;">A dedicated team, scoped and delivered</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div style="position:absolute; left:86%; bottom:82%;">
              <div style="width:12px; height:12px; border-radius:50%; background:#1e1a16;"></div>
              <div style="margin-top:8px; width:170px; transform:translateX(-100%); padding-right:18px;">
                <p style="font-size:14px; font-weight:600; color:#1e1a16; margin:0 0 2px; text-align:right;">Embedded partnership</p>
                <p style="font-size:12px; line-height:1.5; color:#8a7d6e; margin:0; text-align:right;">Full design management and operations</p>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>
          <p style="font-size:11px; letter-spacing:0.13em; text-transform:uppercase; font-weight:600; color:#b5a08a; margin:10px 0 0; text-align:center;">Breadth &nbsp;———&nbsp; Depth</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div style="margin-top:36px; padding-top:22px; border-top:1px solid #e8e2da; display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr; gap:32px;">
    <div>
      <p class="lbl" style="color:#b5a08a; margin-bottom:6px;">Positioning</p>
      <p style="font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#6b6057; margin:0;">A published service catalogue and sales collateral. Partner teams bought the depth they needed.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="lbl" style="color:#b5a08a; margin-bottom:6px;">Commercial</p>
      <p style="font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#6b6057; margin:0;">A P&amp;L. Every designer I hired was paid for by work I had won.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="lbl" style="color:#b5a08a; margin-bottom:6px;">Effect</p>
      <p style="font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#1e1a16; margin:0; font-weight:500;">Design&rsquo;s commercial contribution became visible to senior leadership for the first time.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
